^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ ranges: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ deleted fallback: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ array: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
